Kanlo development baseline

Third-party dependencies are resolved in Cargo.lock. Their respective licenses
apply independently of Kanlo's pending source-available terms.

Principal components: Rust, Axum, Tokio, rusqlite, SQLite, serde, uuid,
thiserror; test dependencies include tower, tempfile and http-body-util.

Before public release: inventory all locked transitive dependencies and bundled
SQLite, collect license texts/notices, assess compatibility with the final Kanlo
license, and verify the product name/trademark. None of these legal gates is
claimed complete by this development scaffold.

